Tilawah bot, third-party content notice
======================================

The Quran text used by this project is the Uthmani text from the Tanzil
project (https://tanzil.net). It was downloaded with `pnpm data:fetch`
and is stored, unchanged, at:

    prisma/data/quran-uthmani.json

The page numbers (the standard Madani Mushaf of 604 pages) and the juz
numbers come from the page and juz boundaries published by the Al Quran
Cloud API (https://alquran.cloud), which mirror the King Fahd Complex
Madani Mushaf layout. They are fetched once, verified hard (604 pages, 30
juz, page 1 is Al-Fatihah, page 2 is Al-Baqarah, page 604 is Al-Ikhlas),
and stored alongside the text.

